Spec: Mobile state authority SQLite verification

Purpose:
  Verify real transactional approval, caller scope and recovery before native Binder integration.

Owns:
  ./AgentRegistryTest.java

Must:
  Verify coalesced attaching-to-draining snapshots persist counters before simulated restart without accepting state regression.
  Verify formal connection operations, policy narrowing, caller-bound one-use attachment, stale snapshot rejection, crash recovery and schema1 migration without altering retained grants.
  Cover explicit local access, reinstall scope, denied pending preservation, stale approval, revocation reservations, open recovery and rollback on failures.
  Keep JDBC and all test databases out of application SDK/runtime dependencies.

  Verify relay policy separation, method conflicts, legacy-path compatibility and retained relay paths after restart.

  Declared relay limits cannot be silently ignored by the experimental stream API.
